.Sh DESCRIPTION
These APIs define explicit section-to-segment mappings for generated ELF files.
Segments are attached to an
.Vt elfobj_t
and can then be used during ELF program-header emission.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Creation functions return a segment handle on success or NULL on failure.
Mutation functions return
.Dv ELF_OK
on success or an error code.
